{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Install the bundled ","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" skill so your AI coding assistant has Swidux’s architecture rules and code templates on hand.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/agentskill"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"article","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"title":"Using the Swidux Agent Skill","role":"article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill (","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill is published in ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","type":"reference"},{"text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SKILL.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-patterns.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppState"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"type":"text","text":", reducers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore"},{"type":"text","text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"Installing the skill","anchor":"Installing-the-skill","type":"heading"},{"level":3,"text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Requires ","type":"text"},{"code":"gh","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ≥ v2.90.0 (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com","type":"reference"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"bash","code":["gh skill install heirloomlogic\/skills swidux-ref --agent claude-code --scope user"],"type":"codeListing"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--scope user"},{"type":"text","text":" installs to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"~\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/"},{"type":"text","text":" (loads in every project)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--scope project"},{"type":"text","text":" installs to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<cwd>\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/"},{"type":"text","text":" (commit it so the whole team gets it)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pin a version with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref@v1.2.3"},{"type":"text","text":". List tags with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"git ls-remote --tags https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Other agents: pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--agent codex"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--agent cursor"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--agent gemini-cli"},{"type":"text","text":", etc. Run "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gh skill install --help"},{"type":"text","text":" for the full list."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":3,"text":"skills.sh","anchor":"skillssh","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"bash","code":["npx skillsadd heirloomlogic\/skills"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Indexes the same source repo. Works without a GitHub CLI install.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Manual (no `gh`, no `npx`)","anchor":"Manual-no-gh-no-npx","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Claude Code uses ","type":"text"},{"code":".claude\/skills\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and others use ","type":"text"},{"code":".agents\/skills\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Pick the directory that matches your agent:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"bash","code":["# Claude Code — project install","mkdir -p .claude\/skills && \\","  curl -fsSL https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/archive\/refs\/heads\/main.tar.gz | \\","  tar -xz --strip-components=2 -C .claude\/skills skills-main\/swidux-ref","","# Codex \/ Cursor \/ Gemini CLI — project install","mkdir -p .agents\/skills && \\","  curl -fsSL https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/archive\/refs\/heads\/main.tar.gz | \\","  tar -xz --strip-components=2 -C .agents\/skills skills-main\/swidux-ref"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swap ","type":"text"},{"code":".claude\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":".agents\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for ","type":"text"},{"code":"~\/.claude\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" etc. for a user-wide install. ","type":"text"},{"code":"tar","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" overwrites by default, so re-running either command updates the skill in place. To pin a version, replace ","type":"text"},{"code":"main","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the URL with the tag name (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref@v1.0.0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Loading content directly (assistants without a skill loader)","anchor":"Loading-content-directly-assistants-without-a-skill-loader","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill f